      "st": "Sebadi sa hao se thibetse ho kena ka Google. Dumella difensetere tse itlhahisang bakeng sa sebaka sena mme o leke hape, kapa o se bule ho Safari / Chrome.",
      "ts": "Browser ya wena yi sivele ku nghena hi Google. Pfumelela mafasitere lama tipfulelaka eka sayiti leyi kutani u ringeta nakambe, kumbe u yi pfula eka Safari / Chrome.",
      "ve": "Browser yaṋu yo thivhela u dzhena nga Google. Tendelani mafasiṱere ane a ḓivula kha sayithi iyi ni lingedze hafhu, kana ni i vule kha Safari / Chrome."
    },
    {
      "key": "loginErrorDomainNotAuthorised",
      "english": "This web address isn’t authorised for Google sign-in yet. Use email + password for now.",
